## ⚡ Quickstart

### 1. Initialize Environment
```bash
# Trust local directory configuration (if using mise)
mise trust

# Setup .env file and install dependencies into .venv
task setup
```

### 2. Run Service / Workflow
{% if project_archetype == 'api-service' %}
```bash
# Start FastAPI dev server with auto-reload (port 8000)
task dev
```
Open interactive Swagger UI docs at: `http://localhost:8000/docs`
{% elif project_archetype == 'data-analytics' %}
```bash
# Launch JupyterLab environment
task notebook

# Execute data extraction & transformation pipeline
task run
```
{% elif project_archetype == 'ai-ml' %}
```bash
# Start model training loop
task train

# Run model evaluation / inference script
task eval
```
{% elif project_archetype == 'pipeline-worker' %}
```bash
# Run background task queue worker
task worker
```
{% elif project_archetype == 'cli-tool' %}
```bash
# Execute local CLI tool
task run -- --help
```
{% elif project_archetype == 'library-package' %}
```bash
# Build wheel and sdist distribution packages
task build
```
{% endif %}

